 "caption": "The coordinates of v = (3, 1) along q₁ and q₂ are just dot products: c₁ = 2√2 and c₂ = √2. The two pieces (2, 2) and (1, −1) are perpendicular, and c₁² + c₂² = 8 + 2 = 10 = ‖v‖².",
