 "description": [
  "q₁ = (1, 1)/√2 and q₂ = (1, −1)/√2 are perpendicular unit vectors.",
  "c₁ = v · q₁ = 2√2 gives the piece (2, 2) along q₁.",
  "c₂ = v · q₂ = √2 gives the piece (1, −1) along q₂.",
  "The pieces add to (3, 1), and 8 + 2 = 10 = ‖v‖²."
